Base: `https://api.<deployment-domain>/v1`, HTTPS only. JSON with schema validation. Required headers: `Authorization: Bearer <Firebase ID token>`, `X-Company-Id`, `X-Device-Id`, `Idempotency-Key` on mutations when applicable. Backend derives/validates membership; caller headers are selectors only.

